#text("Host: shared AMD EPYC9V74 container, five logical CPUs; no isolation tier earned. Workers are debug builds. Reports separate construction, F4, bounded root recovery, local group validation, preparation and enclosing process time. The JSON field named independent_group_validation_ns refers to a local computational pass, not a signed independent verifier. No uncertainty interval, cold pipeline cost, timing ratio or admitted performance tier is supplied. [pcc:unverified]")
